<h2>One finger, full control</h2>

<p>A single slider takes you from a standstill to 400 km/h. No menus full of numbers. No homework. Just speed, color, and motion &mdash; the thrill of acceleration on demand, any time, no track and no ticket.</p>

<h2>Quietly serious</h2>

<p>Honest physics drives every frame, but you never have to think about it. It runs entirely on your device &mdash; no account, no subscription, no catch. Yours to keep, the legendary flat-six silhouette alive with motion wherever you are.</p>

